@title Home-Office Stipend Policy
@subtitle Larkspur Analytics People Operations, effective 2027-01-01

kpi Setup stipend | $500 | one-time | neutral
kpi Monthly | $40 | internet and phone | neutral
kpi Claim within | 60 days | of purchase | neutral

# Who is covered

- All employees who work at least 3 days a week from home.
- You become eligible after 90 days of service.
- Part-time employees receive 50 percent.

# What you get

- A one-time setup stipend of 500 dollars.
- Plus 40 dollars a month toward internet and phone.
- You can use the setup stipend again after 3 years.

# What you can buy

- A desk
- A chair
- A monitor
- A keyboard
- A headset
- Lighting

# How to claim

1. Buy what you need. Purchases over 250 dollars need written manager approval beforehand.
2. Submit your receipts in the expense portal within 60 days of purchase.
3. Reimbursement arrives within 10 business days.

!! Get written manager approval before you buy anything over 250 dollars.

# What is not covered

- Gaming equipment
- Furniture for non-work use
- Software subscriptions
- Anything already supplied by the company

---

Questions? Write to finance-help@larkspur.example or ask in the #finance-help channel.
